=== morning ===
# speaker:pak_harjo
# script:morning
Morning. I saw you clear the edge of the path. People notice work that makes room for others.
* [Ask if the path is public.]
    The path is shared. So is the trouble when nobody tends it.
    -> END
* [Offer to clear more.]
    Finish your own work first. Help given resentfully helps nobody.
    -> END

=== day ===
# speaker:pak_harjo
# script:day
This dry channel used to carry more than water. News travelled along it faster than I did.
* [Ask who maintained it.]
    Everyone nearby, when we remembered that "everyone" includes us.
    -> END
* [Say you want to repair it.]
    Wanting is a start. Measure it, speak to the neighbours, then we can plan the work together.
    -> END

=== evening ===
# speaker:pak_harjo
# script:evening
You have done enough for one day. Tired hands make careless promises.
* [Ask about tomorrow.]
    Tomorrow will arrive without our help. Decide then what deserves your strength.
    -> END
* [Thank him for checking in.]
    I was checking the path. You happened to be standing beside it.
    -> END
